      "title": "Maryland’s exclusive remedy and third parties",
      "text": "The exclusive remedy rule bars an injured employee from suing the employer for negligence but does not bar suits against third parties, such as a manufacturer of defective equipment. Workers compensation insurers may recover their payments from any third-party judgment.",
